<title>UK: Bayern LB sets 300 bln lire 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bayern LB sets 300 bln lire 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers IMI Bank, Monte Dei Paschi and Bayer LB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     5.875 PCT MATURITY    12.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    12.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   1.625</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
